-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Target: Renegade
  Publisher   Imagine, 1988
  Version     1.2

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Target - Renegade (1988)(Imagine)(128K).z80
  MD5         1895877d638a4a5f37a9402bed18f59a

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Colours     Default (the game's own) plus: Enhanced, chosen on the menu, off
              by default.
  Enhanced    Every figure hand-painted by Jon Attree, pixel by pixel: player
              1 in a white vest and blue jeans, player 2 in yellow and red;
              each level's gangs in their own colours (brown leather bikers
              with bare arms, red helmets, blonde and violet street gangs,
              green skinheads and pink mohicans, cap and headband gangs, brown
              dogs, navy-suited bouncers); steel and wooden weapons; black
              edges, no white outlines; the bar bouncers' see-through gaps at
              the waist filled in their suit's colour. Scenery unchanged.
              Source: Enhanced colours: Jon Attree.

  Pace        original (+0.18% measured in JNext 1.1.104, 10 runs per scene,
              Enhanced)

  Changes     1.1: an optional Enhanced colour set, hand-painted by Jon
              Attree; the hooks made faster with the same pictures, so the
              game plays at the original's pace; the bar bouncers' see-through
              gaps filled in Enhanced. 1.2: works on NextZXOS v2.10
              (System/Next 26.11).

  Note        Needs a 1MB Next: the faster hooks keep built sprite images in
              spare RAM. Known issues: Enhanced is a first pass: the level 2
              street gangs' sprites still need some clean-up, coming in a
              later version. Missing: Enhanced on levels 2-5 checked on
              captured states, not by a replay; player 2's lives cheat not
              played; hardware untested.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite time
   2  Infinite lives
   3  Advance level on pause

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

